# QR Order — Dashboard Build Spec

Dark zinc theme (`bg-zinc-950`), orange accent. Sidebar 260px + TopBar h-16.

## Routes
- `/dashboard/orders` — Live kanban (NEW → PREPARING → READY → DELIVERED)
- `/dashboard/kitchen` — Full-screen KDS (no sidebar)
- `/dashboard/tables` — Zone grid + QR panel
- `/dashboard/waiter-calls` — Real-time call queue
- `/dashboard/history` — Stats + order table
- `/dashboard/menu` → `/admin/menu`
- `/dashboard/settings` → `/admin/settings`

## Status mapping
| Column | DB status |
|--------|-----------|
| NEW | `pending` |
| PREPARING | `accepted`, `preparing` |
| READY | `ready` |
| DELIVERED | `delivered` |

## Realtime
Subscribe to `orders` and `waiter_calls` filtered by `location_id`.

## Sound
Web Audio + `/sounds/*.mp3` fallback. Persist toggle in `localStorage` key `qr-order-sound`.

See full prompt in project docs for card designs, drag-and-drop (@dnd-kit), and mobile bottom nav.

